WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
HSK1 has 307 words.

00:04.800 --> 00:07.200
But learning alone is hard.

00:07.200 --> 00:13.200
You can't hear your own tones, you can't check your strokes,
and textbook sentences get boring fast.

00:13.200 --> 00:18.400
Meet HanziFlow, a smart Chinese learning hub
built for HSK1 beginners.

00:18.400 --> 00:23.880
Every day, HanziFlow gives you a simple plan,
a quick review, and your next step.

00:23.880 --> 00:29.720
Start by passing the Pinyin Gate quiz,
then climb fifteen lessons on your learning journey.

00:29.720 --> 00:36.160
Every word comes with a picture, pinyin, and a real example,
and each checkpoint quiz unlocks the next lesson.

00:36.160 --> 00:38.560
Tap the mic and say the word.

00:38.560 --> 00:44.320
Our speech model checks the initial, final, and tone
of every syllable, then gives you a clear score.

00:44.320 --> 00:46.640
Next, writing.

00:46.640 --> 00:49.840
Watch the stroke order, then write it yourself.

00:49.840 --> 00:54.000
HanziFlow checks every stroke, not just the final shape.

00:54.000 --> 00:58.080
Write in the wrong order, and it tells you
which part comes first, explains the rule,

00:58.080 --> 01:01.360
and replays the correct strokes for you.

01:01.360 --> 01:03.320
Want more practice?

01:03.320 --> 01:07.800
Pick words you've already learned, and our
language model generates a short new context,

01:07.800 --> 01:10.760
checked to use only HSK1 words.

01:10.760 --> 01:18.200
Test yourself with eight types of listening and reading questions,
then take a full HSK1 mock exam on the official scoring scale.

01:18.200 --> 01:22.280
Earn XP, keep your streak, and unlock badges as you go.

01:22.280 --> 01:25.600
HanziFlow. Learn Chinese the smart way.
